cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "invdx"
abstract: >-
  A GPU FDTD toolbox for passive photonic devices that runs simulations on
  FDTDX (JAX, GPU, differentiable) and cross-checks that engine against Meep
  through a subprocess bridge, behind one config-driven methodology layer.
  Includes a six-gate verification framework, and adjoint gradients with an
  inverse-design loop.
type: software
